cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "paired-counterfactual-eval: causal evaluation of world models against strong baselines"
abstract: >-
  A paired-counterfactual evaluation harness for world models. Given the same
  physical state, it executes several candidate first actions for real and
  decomposes the world model's net contribution into candidate coverage and
  ranking regret, with origin-cluster bootstrap intervals and a crash-safe,
  hash-verified provenance trail.
